    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Henry Kee & Son are thrilled to offer for sale this very individual 4 bedroom detached house ideally situated in the popular 'Beeches' development approx. 500m from Ballybofey. The current owner has spent considerable time and money to develop this into a home full of character. Ground floor accommodation comprises Entrance Hall, Sitting Room, Kitchen-Diner, Utility, WC and integral garage; upstairs there are with 4 Bedrooms, (2 with ensuite shower rooms) and luxurious Family Bathroom. The integral garage provides additional space and offers the possibility of conversion to additional living accommodation. The first floor layout has been completely reconfigured from the original plan and now offers ensuite shower rooms of 2 Bedrooms and a luxury Bathroom. The landing space now incorporates space to accommodate a staircase to the attic, which with 3 velux windows already in place offers excellent potential for conversion (subject to planning). Featuring top quality materials and finished throughout including solid wood flooring, solid maple kitchen, solid Pine doors, extensive tiling, dual central heating plus many more. Viewing is a must, strictly by appointment only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall, Sitting Room, Kitchen-Diner, Utility, WC, integral Garage, 4 Bedrooms (2 ensuite) and Family Bathroom.<br><br>\nEntrance Hall - 2.3m x 1.9m <br>Tiled floor.\nBespoke open tread stairs with feature tile inserts matching the tiled floor.\nInternal glass block feature between Hall and Dining area.<br><br><br>\nSitting Room - 5.9m x 4.0m <br>Solid wood cherry floor,\nBay window to front with wooden shutters.\nOpen fire with back boiler.\n2 double radiators.\nDownlighters.<br><br><br>\nKitchen / Dining Room - 6.0m x 4.2m (Max measurement) <br>Tiled floor.\nSolid Maple high and low level kitchen uniits.\nBalck quartz worktop and splashback.\nIntegrated fridge freezer.\nIntegrated double oven, electric four ring hob.\nExtractor fan.\nFree standing dishwasher.\nWindow to rear. \nDining area\nPatio door to rear garden.\n4 stem light fitting.<br><br><br>\nUtility Room - 2.9m x 2.1m <br>Tiled floor carried through from kitchen.\nDoor to rear.\nOil burner.\nPlumbed for washing machine & tumble dryer.\nFuseboard.<br><br><br>\nWC - 2.6m x 0.9m <br>Tiled floor carried through from Utility.\nWHB & WC (white).\nWindow.\nRadiator.<br><br><br>\nLanding - 4.0m long <br>Solid maple floor.\nHotpress.\nTrap door to attic.<br><br><br>\nBedroom One - 3.4m x 3.1m <br>Solid maple floor.\n2 windows to front.\nDouble radiator.<br><br><br>\nEn-suite - 2.2m x 1.0m <br>Walls fully tiled.\nCathedral style tiles on floor.\nWHB & WC (white)\nTriton T90si shower.\nRadiator.\nWindow.<br><br><br>\nBedroom Two - 3.7m x 3.3m <br>Solid maple floor.\nWindow to rear.\nAlarm keypad.<br><br><br>\nEn-suite - 2.5m x 1.0m <br>Walls fully tiled.\nCathedral style tiles on floor.\nWHB & WC (white)\nTriton T90si shower.\nRadiator.\nWindow.<br><br><br>\nBedroom Three - 2.8m x 2.7, <br>Maple floor.\nWindow to rear.\nRadiator.<br><br><br>\nBedroom Four - 2.8m x 2.4m <br>Maple floor.\nWindow to front.\nRadiator. <br><br><br>\nBathroom - 4.0m x 3.0m <br>Finished in a warm, traditional style with a refined, contemporary touch.\nEach wall has an individual finish, from exposed brick, to grey tongue n'groove panelling, green box panelling, and a striking botanical artwork on the internal ceiling.\nDouble ended free standing bath.\nBlue freestanding vanity unit featuring a dark wood countertop and a round vessel sink. \nWhite WC.\nLaminate floor.\nVelux window.\nTwo chrome and grey heated towel rails/radiators.<br><br><br>\nIntegral Garage - 6.6m x 3.1m <br>Roller shutter door.\nWindow.\nNo of sockets.<br><br>"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Presented in excellent order.\n2 Bedroom with ensuite shower rooms both with electric showers.\nHigh quality materials and finishes throughout.\nShort walk from Twin Towns.\nIntegral garage."
      },
